{"id":"e3f4972a759538ba","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Corson Compactum","display":"df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Corson Compactum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Corson Compactum","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology]]","[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-corson-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Corson Compactum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3639c3f839b6c954\" href=\"?note=3639c3f839b6c954\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (compact space candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> (index set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (standard topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\Pi\">\\(\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\Pi\\)</span> (constant coordinate families and their product topology)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:|\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:x(\\gamma)\\neq0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:|\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:x(\\gamma)\\neq0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>（下式中直接展开的目标载体）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> (compact-Hausdorff predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3639c3f839b6c954\" href=\"?note=3639c3f839b6c954\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\)</span> (product-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CorsonCompactum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CorsonCompactum}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a> 的唯一通常实拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的初始序数基数函数，不是未声明的额外大小参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}corson\\text{-}compactum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CorsonCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists\\Gamma,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\Pi,K,f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\Gamma,\\{\\mathbb R\\})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\Gamma,\\{\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\})\\land(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\vec X(\\gamma)=\\mathbb R\\land\\vec\\tau(\\gamma)=\\tau_{\\mathbb R}))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\Gamma,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb R^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land K\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:|\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:x(\\gamma)\\neq0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(f,X,\\tau,K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_\\Pi\\}\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}corson\\text{-}compactum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CorsonCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists\\Gamma,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\Pi,K,f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\Gamma,\\{\\mathbb R\\})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\Gamma,\\{\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\})\\land(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\vec X(\\gamma)=\\mathbb R\\land\\vec\\tau(\\gamma)=\\tau_{\\mathbb R}))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\Gamma,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb R^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land K\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^\\Gamma:|\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:x(\\gamma)\\neq0\\}|\\leq\\aleph_0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(f,X,\\tau,K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_\\Pi\\}\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The target carries the subspace topology inherited from the explicitly constructed product topology; an arbitrary compact topology on the same carrier would not define a Corson compactum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","